    "description": "KDRIVE-019 (kDrive), the catalogue's repro: the temp dir on another mount than the root. Rule A5 (F9 in today's code, TempBlob in the system temp dir): no byte of a download is spooled outside the target's own folder.",
    "steps": [
      { "op": "drive_create", "remote": "r" },
